---
description: Repository language, role and ownership conventions
alwaysApply: true
---

- Write everything in this repository in English: docs, code, comments, identifiers, UI strings, commit messages, PRs. Team chat is in Russian. Even when a request arrives in Russian, keep repository content in English.
- At the start of a session, ask the human which role you are on (`ui`, `hooks` or `pet`) unless the prompt already says so.
- Edit only the paths that role owns (see the "Claim a role" table in `AGENTS.md`). For anything outside them, write a change note instead of editing. `contract/` changes must be additive and go in a separate `contract: …` PR.
- The design source of truth is `docs/foundation-spec.md`. New features get a spec in `docs/specs/<role>-<feature>.md`.
